    "proseDraft": "It was confirmed that Support and engineering will get the email out together. No unresolved items were recorded, and the remaining remarks were recorded only as stated.\n\nConfirmed by participants\n- It was confirmed that Support and engineering get the email out together, as confirmed by Imani, Felix, and Sunil, with recheck passed.\n\nStated in the meeting\n- It was stated that the credits would be applied by Thursday.\n- It was stated that the customer emails would be handled by tomorrow.\n- It was stated that sounds good.\n- It was stated that yep, it makes sense.\n- It was stated as a request for Imani to close out the open tickets once the email is out, pointing to it.\n- It was stated that yes, that would be done with a macro.\n- It was stated that the postmortem would be published on the blog after legal reads it.\n- It was stated that the status page went up twenty minutes late.\n- It was stated that a step would be added for it.\n- It was stated as a question whether those fifteen are inside the two hundred and twelve.\n- It was stated that there had not been a cross-check."
